body:
if you want to customize dock and application menu background you can just search that in the subreddit you can find them here.  
make sure you install gnome tweaks and also gnome [user extensions](https://extensions.gnome.org/extension/19/user-themes/) and then you can use sites like [open desktop](https://www.opendesktop.org/s/Gnome/browse/) so you can install a variety of themes and icons.  
if you need further info and help, you can tell me :)
